    "lawCode": "Rpld §925-t, Gen Muni L",
    "lawSection": "General Municipal",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S368A\n\nSPONSOR: GALLIVAN\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act relating to the town of Concord industrial development agency\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nThis legislation will effectuate the delisting of the Town of Concord\nIndustrial Development Agency from the New York State Comptroller's list\nof active public authorities.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1 of the bill dissolves the facilities and operations of the\ntown of Concord industrial development agency.\n\nSection 2 establishes the effective date.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThe Town of Concord, situated within Erie County, has requested this\nlegislation to dissolve the Town of Concord Industrial Development Agen-\ncy (IDA) in the statute, as a result of such IDA having no assets and no\nfunds and that it has terminated all its legal obligations, bonds, notes\nand straight-lease transactions and, by Town resolution, was deemed to\nhave ceased existence on July 13, 2022.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNew bill.\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nImmediately.\n",
